        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8466, Traditional Arched # 8 Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Arched Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a great choice for traditional homes. It will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. This Traditional Arched # 8 Single Cylinder Deadbolt has a split finish. The exterior is US15 satin nickel and the interior is US4 satin brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arched Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek #8 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Exterior: US15 Satin Nickel/ Interior: US4 Satin Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sole Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
